      },
      {
        "source": "Theorem 11.2",
        "published_authorship": "Connor\u2013Jambor\u2013Leemans, Theorem1.1",
        "exact_scope": "The printed universal wording is false: the classification concerns maximum C-rank, equal4 exactly at the listed parameters, otherwise3. For instance PSL2(11) and PGL2(5) also have rank-three representations. The full arbitrary-diagram classification remains borrowed.",
